{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"EST","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"以斯帖記","commonName":"以斯帖記","title":"以斯帖記","order":17,"numberOfChapters":10,"sha256":"47524b4842a2215be8a6b0ce22f44d06eec621f2e1a8d1871d3d265cbb8a743b","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/EST/1.json","lastChapterNumber":10,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/EST/10.json","totalNumberOfVerses":165},"chapter":{"number":7,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["哈曼被處死"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["王帶着哈曼來赴王后以斯帖的筵席。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["這第二次在酒席筵前，王又問以斯帖說：「王后以斯帖啊，你要甚麼，我必賜給你；你求甚麼，*就是國的一半也必為你成就。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["王后以斯帖回答說：「我若在王眼前蒙恩，王若以為美，我所願的，是願王將我的性命賜給我；我所求的，是求王將我的本族賜給我。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["因我和我的本族被賣了，要剪除殺戮滅絕我們。我們若被賣為奴為婢，我也閉口不言；但王的損失，敵人萬不能補足。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["亞哈隨魯王問王后以斯帖說：「擅敢起意如此行的是誰？這人在哪裏呢？」"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["以斯帖說：「仇人敵人就是這惡人哈曼！」 哈曼在王和王后面前就甚驚惶。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["王便大怒，起來離開酒席往御園去了。哈曼見王定意要加罪與他，就起來，求王后以斯帖救命。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["王從御園回到酒席之處，見哈曼伏在以斯帖所靠的榻上；王說：「他竟敢在宮內、在我面前凌辱王后嗎？」這話一出王口，人就蒙了哈曼的臉。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["伺候王的一個太監名叫哈波拿，說：「哈曼為那救王有功的末底改做了五丈高的木架，現今立在哈曼家裏。」王說：「把哈曼掛在其上。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["於是人將哈曼掛在他為末底改所預備的木架上。王的忿怒這才止息。"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/EST/7.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/EST/8.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/EST/6.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":10}